2
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:19,000
ここはねぼらぼ学園！
This is Nepolabo Academy!

3
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:24,000
部活もクラスも違うけど、ねねたち同じ学生寮に住んでるんだ！
Our clubs and classes are different, but we all live in the same dorm!

4
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:28,000
ふざけて、笑って、時々喧嘩して！
Goofing off, laughing, fighting sometimes...

5
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:30,800
でも集まると…なんか落ち着く！
...but when we're together, it feels comforting!

6
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:34,000
今日も談話室は賑やか。
The common room is lively again today.

7
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:38,000
誰かの声が聞こえるだけで、安心するんだよね。
Just hearing someone's voice puts me at ease.

8
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:42,500
この場所で私達だけの学寮生活を作るなんて…
Creating our very own dorm life here...

9
00:03:42,500 --> 00:03:45,000
楽しそうでワクワクする！
...sounds so fun and exciting!

10
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:54,800
さあ！
Now!

11
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:55,800
私たちの！
Our...

12
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:58,000
輝く青春が…
...shining youth...

13
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,000
始まる！
...begins!

14
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:05,500
ねぼらぼ学園！5周年記念！輝く学祭！
Nepolabo Academy! 5th Anniversary Special! Shining School Festival!

15
00:04:12,500 --> 00:04:18,000
今日は学祭！生徒会が中心になって開催する、夏の一大イベント！
Today is the school festival! A major summer event hosted mainly by the student council!

16
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:24,200
会長からの頼みで、急遽ねぼらぼで出し物を考えることになったんだけど――
At the student council president's request, Nepolabo was suddenly asked to plan a performance...

17
00:04:24,500 --> 00:04:27,500
何も考えられてなーーーい！！！！
...but we haven't thought of ANYTHING!!!!

18
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:32,500
やばいよ…気づいたら、もう当日だよ～～～！
This is bad... Before we knew it, it's already the day of the event!

19
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:36,200
だから言ったじゃん！もっと早く集まって決めようって！
That's why I told you! We should've gotten together earlier to decide!

20
00:04:36,500 --> 00:04:41,200
いや〜何とかなるって思ってたんだけどな〜（笑）
Well, I honestly thought it would work out somehow, haha!

21
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:47,500
うう…これはマズい…変なことやったら、会長になんて言われるか……
Ugh... This is bad... If we mess up, who knows what the president will say...

22
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:50,500
はぁ……
Haaah...

23
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:52,500
よしっ、断ろう！！
Alright, let's decline!!

24
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:56,000
やめなー！当日に断れるわけないでしょ！
Stop it! There's no way we can cancel on the day of!

25
00:04:56,200 --> 00:05:00,000
大丈夫大丈夫、ラミちゃんならきっと許してくれるって♪
It's okay, it's okay! I'm sure Lamy-chan will forgive us!

26
00:05:00,048 --> 00:05:00,648
大丈夫大丈夫、ラミィちゃんならきっと許してくれるって♪
"Don't worry, Lamy-chan will surely forgive us♪"

27
00:05:00,848 --> 00:05:03,548
なんでラミィだけ謝る前提なのよ！
"Why are you assuming only Lamy has to apologize?!"

28
00:05:04,248 --> 00:05:11,248
...いや、まだ終わってない！！学景祭はお昼から... ほんのちょっとだけ、まだ時間はある！
"...No, it's not over yet!! The festival starts at noon... We still have a little bit of time!"

29
00:05:11,848 --> 00:05:14,548
よし、とりあえず案を出してみよっか～
"Alright, let's brainstorm some ideas for now~"

30
00:05:15,548 --> 00:05:25,548
学校の祭りといえば... 焼きそば、じゃがバター、唐揚げ、クレープ、ポテト...
"When you think of school festivals... Yakisoba, buttered potatoes, fried chicken, crepes, fries..."

31
00:05:25,848 --> 00:05:27,548
食べ物しかないじゃん！！
"It's all food!!"

32
00:05:28,048 --> 00:05:31,548
...でも今から仕込みはちょっと無理かもね
"...But preparing food from scratch now might be impossible."

33
00:05:32,048 --> 00:05:40,848
まあできるとしたら 炎天下でカラカラな喉に染み渡る... ラミィ水！！ これは売れるぞ～
"Well, if there's anything we can do... Lamy Water, to quench parched throats in the scorching heat!! This is gonna sell~"

34
00:05:41,248 --> 00:05:42,548
やめろぉぉぉ！！！
"Stop ittt!!!"

35
00:05:43,048 --> 00:05:46,248
うっひょ～お！ しぼり出して～
"Whew~! Squeeze it out~"

36
00:05:46,848 --> 00:05:50,548
バカなこと言ってないで！もっと真面目に考えなさいって！
"Stop saying stupid things! Think more seriously!"

37
00:05:51,248 --> 00:05:54,548
そんなに言うならラミィちゃんは何がいいの？
"If you say so, what do you want to do, Lamy-chan?"

38
00:05:55,048 --> 00:06:01,848
ラミィ？ そうだなあ... やっぱ歌は歌いたいし... バンドとか、かな？
"Me? Well... I still want to sing... Maybe a band or something?"

39
00:06:02,548 --> 00:06:03,548
ふつう
"Boring."

40
00:06:04,048 --> 00:06:05,548
ひねりがな～い
"No twist at all~"

41
00:06:06,048 --> 00:06:07,048
......っツ（笑）
"...(snicker)"

42
00:06:07,248 --> 00:06:08,548
こいつら...！
"These guys...!"

43
00:06:09,048 --> 00:06:12,248
でもまあ、歌はいいかもね～
"But well, singing might be good~"

44
00:06:12,848 --> 00:06:17,548
ショート動画用にいろいろな曲練習してるし その中から何かやってみる？
"We've been practicing various songs for short videos anyway, so why don't we try performing one of those?"

45
00:06:18,048 --> 00:06:22,548
じゃあねね、あれやりたい！！ 元気いっぱいの、ねねたちにピッタリなやつ！！
"Then Nene wants to do THAT one!! The super energetic one that's perfect for us!!"

46
00:06:23,048 --> 00:06:25,548
あ～～あれね！
"Ahhh, that one!"

47
00:06:26,048 --> 00:06:27,248
いいんじゃない！
"Sounds good!"

48
00:06:27,548 --> 00:06:30,048
じゃ、とりあえずやってみますか！
"Alright, then shall we give it a try?"

49
00:06:30,548 --> 00:06:33,048
キメマスター！！
"Kime Master!!"

50
00:06:50,848 --> 00:06:54,548
前人ゼロの未踏地だよなぁ (そいやー！)
"It's an uncharted land with zero predecessors! (Soiya!)"

51
00:07:03,848 --> 00:07:08,548
生まれ変わる一歩目は 一歩目が大事さ 恐れないよ
"The first step to transforming yourself... That first step is crucial, don't be afraid"

52
00:07:08,848 --> 00:07:13,548
何度でも平気な顔で走り出して 行かなきゃ！上々の気分さ
"Start running again and again with a cool face! Got to go! Feelin' great"

53
00:07:13,848 --> 00:07:18,548
やってみたいことには欲張りだね 欲張りごめんね 直さないよ
"Greedy for things we wanna try! Sorry for being greedy, won't change it"

54
00:07:18,848 --> 00:07:23,548
何度でも未来を書き換えたくなるのさ 行かなきゃ！最高の仲間と
"Makes you wanna rewrite the future over and over! Got to go! With the best crew"

55
00:07:23,848 --> 00:07:28,548
星になろうよ 輝きたいよ 今は今だけ (後悔しないようにねっ)
"Let's become stars, wanna shine! Right now, just right now (So we don't have regrets)"

56
00:07:28,848 --> 00:07:30,548
さぁおいで MONSTERS
"Come on over, MONSTERS"

57
00:07:30,648 --> 00:07:32,248
踊れば MONSTERS
"If we dance, MONSTERS"

58
00:07:32,348 --> 00:07:34,048
こんなにも無敵 PIKA STARS!
"So completely invincible, PIKA STARS!"

59
00:07:34,048 --> 00:07:36,248
夢が KIRA-KIRA 無駄に KIRA-KIRA？？
"Dreams are KIRA-KIRA, excessively KIRA-KIRA??"

60
00:07:36,248 --> 00:07:38,048
前進だ DOKA-DOKA！！
"Charge ahead, DOKA-DOKA!!"

61
00:07:38,048 --> 00:07:39,048
はわっ 通りまーす！
"Hawatt, passing through~!"

62
00:07:39,048 --> 00:07:39,848
キまっちゃってる！？
"Are we totally locked in?!"

63
00:07:39,848 --> 00:07:41,848
全速モードでよいしょっしょ 制限はね無視だよ
"Full speed mode, yo-ho-ho! Ignore all limits"

64
00:07:41,848 --> 00:07:44,248
なんでもかんでもやっぱっぱ 全力がいいよね
"Anything and everything, after all, full power is best"

65
00:07:44,248 --> 00:07:48,848
笑顔あり キメ顔あり 最強 BIG BANG 狙っちゃえ未来！ (チェストー！)
"Smiles on, cool faces on! Aim for the strongest BIG BANG future! (Chesto~!)"

66
00:07:49,048 --> 00:07:51,848
手とりあったらるんったった 怖くはないよね
"Hand in hand, tra-la-la, it's not scary at all"

67
00:07:51,848 --> 00:07:54,848
夢の計測メーターは 振り切れそうだよ
"The dream measurement meter is about to max out"

68
00:07:54,848 --> 00:07:58,248
地球からやってきたボクらは 本日も Go ahead! Go ahead!
"We who came from Earth are heading forward today too! Go ahead! Go ahead!"

69
00:07:58,248 --> 00:08:04,548
怒られるまで？ 怒られても止まれ無いのです (騒々しくてもごめんなさーい！)
"Until we get scolded? Even if scolded, we can't be stopped! (Sorry for being noisy~!)"

70
00:08:04,848 --> 00:08:07,048
先陣誰だい？ ボクらだい！
"Who's leading the charge? We are!"

71
00:08:07,048 --> 00:08:10,048
いわゆる前人ゼロの未踏地だよなぁ (そいやー！)
"The so-called uncharted land with zero predecessors! (Soiya!)"

72
00:08:19,548 --> 00:08:24,548
ゆずらないないない百歩目も 百歩ゆずるなんて負けよ駄目よ
"Won't give up even a hundred steps! Giving an inch is defeat, no way"

73
00:08:24,548 --> 00:08:29,548
ゴールへのロードは砂利と岩だらけで 泣いても顔は “に・や・り”
"The road to the goal is full of gravel and rocks, even if crying, our face wears a grin"

74
00:08:29,548 --> 00:08:34,548
そんな時あきらめ悪く進め だってほらあきらめたくない夢が
"At times like that, persistently press on! Because look, there's a dream we won't give up on"

75
00:08:34,548 --> 00:08:39,548
進化してみんなを果ての果ての空へ 連れ去るボクら地球女子
"Evolving to carry everyone to the furthest sky, us Earth girls"

76
00:08:39,548 --> 00:08:44,548
憧れたんだ 星の光は 消えないときめき (心拍数上がりまくりっ)
"We longed for it, star's light is an everlasting thrill (Heart rate soaring up)"

77
00:08:44,548 --> 00:08:46,548
さぁ跳んで MONSTERS
"Come on, jump, MONSTERS"

78
00:08:46,548 --> 00:08:48,548
暴れちゃお MONSTERS
"Let's go wild, MONSTERS"

79
00:08:48,548 --> 00:08:52,248
だいたんで無敵 PIKA STARS! 随時きらめきが上昇中 つまり好調中
"Bold and invincible PIKA STARS! Sparkle rising continuously, meaning in top condition"

80
00:08:52,248 --> 00:08:53,548
あ、サビきまーす
"Ah, chorus coming up~"

81
00:08:53,548 --> 00:08:55,248
多分勝利は、キまっちゃってる！！ (いいとこだったのにー！)
"Victory is probably locked in!! (Right at the best part, too~!)"

82
00:08:55,248 --> 00:08:57,848
バンドじゃないからせっせっせ カッコつけなければ
"Not a band, so gotta work hard to look cool"

83
00:08:57,848 --> 00:09:00,048
バンドじゃないからよいよいよい カッコがつくのだよ
"Not a band, so yo-yo-yo, that's what makes it look cool"

84
00:09:00,048 --> 00:09:04,848
バカ騒ぎ やんちゃ騒ぎ やったもん勝ち 狙っちゃえ未来！ (チェストー！)
"Wild noise, mischievous fun, winner takes all, aim for the future! (Chesto~!)"

85
00:09:04,848 --> 00:09:08,048
銀河のどっかの頂点に旗を立てるまで
"Until we plant a flag at the peak of somewhere in the galaxy"

86
00:09:08,048 --> 00:09:10,848
ニューなレコードの更新は続くんだってば
"Updating new records keeps on going, I tell ya"

87
00:09:10,848 --> 00:09:14,048
地球からやってきたボクらよ やりまくれ Go ahead! Go ahead!
"We who came from Earth! Go all out, Go ahead! Go ahead!"

88
00:09:14,048 --> 00:09:17,048
さあ次の星へ！
"Now onto the next star!"

89
00:09:22,548 --> 00:09:27,548
一歩が百歩の始まりだから行こうよ すぐに行こうよ
"Because one step is the start of a hundred, let's go, let's go right away"

90
00:09:27,548 --> 00:09:32,848
無理は道理よりも強引だなー 瞬間をキミと一緒にね
"Unreasonable forces overrule reason~ Spending this moment with you"

91
00:09:33,048 --> 00:09:37,848
真っ暗な空かもしれないけどボクらは輝きたい お目々を開いてお目々を離すなよー？
"It might be a pitch-black sky, but we wanna shine! Open your eyes and don't look away~?"

92
00:09:38,048 --> 00:09:40,048
もんスター！ もんスター！ もんスター！
"Monster! Monster! Monster!"

93
00:09:40,048 --> 00:09:45,048
前人未踏の宇宙に全速の全力でGOだyeah！！
"Into the uncharted universe, GO with full speed and full power, yeah!!"

94
00:09:58,548 --> 00:10:00,048
楽観だい そうだそうだった
"Optimistic, right, that's how it was!"

95
00:10:00,023 --> 00:10:01,323
楽観的 そうだそうだっ
Optimistic! That's right, that's right!

96
00:10:01,323 --> 00:10:03,423
地球はブルーだブルーだっ
Earth is blue, it's blue!

97
00:10:03,423 --> 00:10:08,523
ぜんぶを欲しがれ EARTHっ子！
Want everything, Earth kids!

98
00:10:08,523 --> 00:10:10,823
全開かい そうかもそうかもっ
Full speed ahead? Maybe so, maybe so!

99
00:10:10,823 --> 00:10:13,823
宇宙のスターにスターに
A star in the universe, a star...

100
00:10:13,823 --> 00:10:16,123
なりたい？ / なりたい
Want to become? / I want to become...

101
00:10:16,123 --> 00:10:22,523
なれそう？なれそうだよ！
Can we? Looks like we can!

102
00:10:22,523 --> 00:10:23,723
キマッチッたしね！
We're all set!

103
00:10:23,723 --> 00:10:26,123
全速モードでよいしょっしょ 制限はね無視だよ
Full speed mode, heave-ho! Ignore the limits!

104
00:10:26,123 --> 00:10:28,923
なんでもかんでもやっぱっぱ 全力がいいよね
Everything, after all, going all out is best!

105
00:10:28,923 --> 00:10:30,923
笑顔終わり 日替わり
Ending with a smile, changing daily...

106
00:10:30,923 --> 00:10:33,223
最強BIG BANG 狙っちゃえ未来！
Strongest BIG BANG, target the future!

107
00:10:33,223 --> 00:10:34,223
チェストー！
Chest!

108
00:10:34,223 --> 00:10:36,223
手とりあったらるんたった 怖くはないよね
Holding hands, tra-la-la, it's not scary!

109
00:10:36,223 --> 00:10:39,023
夢の計測メーターは 振り切れそうだよ
The meter measuring dreams is about to overflow!

110
00:10:39,023 --> 00:10:41,023
地球から やっできたボクらは
We who came from Earth...

111
00:10:41,023 --> 00:10:43,023
本日も Go ahead! Go ahead!
Go ahead today as well! Go ahead!

112
00:10:43,023 --> 00:10:44,823
怒られるまで？
Until we get scolded?

113
00:10:44,823 --> 00:10:47,823
･･･怒られても止まれないのです
...Even if scolded, we can't stop.

114
00:10:47,823 --> 00:10:49,023
最後の最後もごめんなさーい！
To the very, very end, sorry!

115
00:10:49,023 --> 00:10:51,023
先陣誰だい？ ボクらだい！
Who's taking the lead? We are!

116
00:10:51,023 --> 00:10:53,623
いわゆる前人ゼロの未踏地だよなあ
An unexplored territory with zero predecessors, huh?

117
00:10:53,623 --> 00:10:54,323
もう一回！
One more time!

118
00:10:54,323 --> 00:10:56,523
大いなる一歩さ ボクらと最高速で
A giant step, at top speed with us!

119
00:10:56,523 --> 00:10:58,723
前人ゼロの未踏地へ Go！！
Go to the unexplored land with zero predecessors!!

120
00:10:58,723 --> 00:11:00,023
そいやー！
Soiyaa!

121
00:11:14,823 --> 00:11:20,923
よ〜っし次はバンドだ！ できる曲を片っ端からやっていこう〜〜！！
"Alright, next up is the band! Let's play every song we can!!"

122
00:11:21,023 --> 00:11:24,323
でもわたしたち、楽器できなくない……？
"But wait... aren't we unable to play instruments...?"

123
00:11:24,423 --> 00:11:32,523
こういうのはね、雰囲気が大事！ 頑張ってる姿を見せれば、それでOK！
"You see, with things like this, the mood is key! If you show them you're trying hard, that's enough!"

124
00:11:32,623 --> 00:11:35,023
バカにしておいて結局やるのね…
"Making fun of it, but in the end you're still going along..."

125
00:11:35,023 --> 00:11:39,923
じゃあまず、誰が何やるか決めよう〜！ ねねはギターっ！！
"Alright then, first let's decide who plays what! Nene is on guitar!!"

126
00:11:40,023 --> 00:11:42,023
じゃあししろんはドラムかな〜
"Well then, Shishiron will probably do drums~"

127
00:11:42,123 --> 00:11:44,823
ポルカはベースで〜！
"Polka is on bass~!"

128
00:11:44,923 --> 00:11:48,823
じゃあラミィは…シンセ、やろうかなっ
"Then I guess Lamy will play synth!"

129
00:11:48,923 --> 00:11:52,023
そうしたら演出も考えないとな〜
"In that case, we also gotta plan the stage performance~"

130
00:11:52,023 --> 00:11:55,223
派手にドカーンってしたい！！
"I wanna do a huge, flashy explosion!!"

131
00:11:55,323 --> 00:11:57,623
ざっくりだな〜
"That's pretty vague~"

132
00:11:57,723 --> 00:12:00,023
サビにキャノンとか出す？
"Should we fire off cannons during the chorus?"

133
00:12:00,023 --> 00:12:04,623
いいね！ 照明もレーザー出したりしてピカピカにしていこう！
"Nice! Let's make the lights flash with lasers and stuff too!"

134
00:12:04,623 --> 00:12:08,823
じゃあ、ねねはポルカと動き回ってパフォーマンスしよう！
"Then Nene and Polka will move all around and perform!"

135
00:12:08,823 --> 00:12:11,823
やるやるっ！任せて〜！！
"Count me in! Leave it to me~!!"

136
00:12:12,023 --> 00:12:17,323
だ、大丈夫かな？ 間に合わなくってアタフタするんじゃない？
"I-Is this really okay? Won't we end up flustered and running out of time?"

137
00:12:17,323 --> 00:12:21,523
まぁ、それも”わたし達らしさ”ってことで〜
"Well, that's just being ourselves too~"

138
00:12:21,523 --> 00:12:24,723
ノリでなんとかなるなる！
"We'll make it work with good energy!"

139
00:12:25,023 --> 00:12:29,023
…あ、そうだ、バンド名、どうするの？
"...Ah, right, what about our band name?"

140
00:12:29,223 --> 00:12:32,623
えっ！かっこいいやつがいい〜！！
"Eh! I want something really cool~!!"

141
00:12:32,823 --> 00:12:36,823
じゃあ 「青春★ピチピチフルスロットル団！！」
"Then 'Youth ★ Lively Full Throttle Group!!'"

142
00:12:37,023 --> 00:12:38,923
…だ、ださっ!?!?
"...Th-That's so lame!?!?"

143
00:12:39,023 --> 00:12:45,623
もうちょい5期生要素も入れ we want to add 5th gen elements. ラーメン、芝刈り機、低気圧……
"I want to add a bit more 5th gen elements too. Ramen, lawnmower, low pressure..."

144
00:12:45,723 --> 00:12:48,523
「カブトムシ」って入れたらかっこいいよ！！
"Adding 'Rhinoceros Beetle' would make it so cool!!"

145
00:12:48,623 --> 00:12:51,823
「青春低気圧★ラーメンピチピチフルスロットル芝刈り機団！！」
"'Youth Low Pressure ★ Ramen Lively Full Throttle Lawnmower Group!!'"

146
00:12:51,823 --> 00:12:54,823
混ぜるな！ぐちゃぐちゃだよぉ…
"Don't mix them together! It's total chaos..."

147
00:12:54,823 --> 00:12:57,223
じゃあラミィちゃんは何がいいの？
"Then Lamy-chan, what would you like?"

148
00:12:57,323 --> 00:13:05,523
え〜やっぱり可愛いのがいいかなぁ〜 「ねぼらぼハーモニー♪」とか〜♪
"Hmm... as expected, I'd prefer something cute~ Like 'NeBoLaBo Harmony♪'~♪"

149
00:13:05,623 --> 00:13:07,523
それでいいのかラミィ
"Are you really fine with that, Lamy?"

150
00:13:07,523 --> 00:13:09,123
かっこよくないよラミィ
"That's not cool at all, Lamy."

151
00:13:09,123 --> 00:13:11,423
俺、恥ずかしいよラミィ
"Man, I'm embarrassed, Lamy."

152
00:13:11,423 --> 00:13:14,823
ほんっとに……お前らっ！！
"Seriously... you guys!!"

153
00:13:14,823 --> 00:13:18,823
よ〜〜し！バンド名も決まったし、やってみますか〜！！
"Alright! Now that we have a band name, shall we give it a try~!!"

154
00:13:18,823 --> 00:13:23,223
これで、学僚祭の注目はいただきだーっ！！
"With this, all eyes at the school festival will be on us!!"

155
00:13:23,223 --> 00:13:25,523
えっ！？あれでいくの！？
"Huh!? We're actually going with that!?"

156
00:13:25,523 --> 00:13:28,523
いくぞーっ！！よ〜いっ！
"Here we go!! Get ready!"

157
00:13:28,523 --> 00:13:30,523
どん！！！
"Bang!!!"

158
00:13:57,023 --> 00:14:02,823
走って 走って 憧れを越えて
Run, run, surpassing admiration!

159
00:14:03,023 --> 00:14:04,823
Ready!!

160
00:14:05,223 --> 00:14:07,023
Steady!!

161
00:14:08,023 --> 00:14:10,523
Derby!!

162
00:14:13,523 --> 00:14:19,523
まだ見たことのないスピードの向こう側へ
Towards the other side of a speed yet unseen!

163
00:14:19,523 --> 00:14:21,023
ウォームアップは完璧さ！
The warm-up is perfect!

164
00:14:21,223 --> 00:14:24,823
地球をほら 踏み込む蹄鉄
Look, horseshoes stomping upon the Earth!

165
00:14:25,023 --> 00:14:27,023
ゴール前のキセキ
The miracle before the goal line!

166
00:14:27,023 --> 00:14:30,823
仕掛ける場所は最終コーナー
The place to make our move is the final corner!

167
00:14:30,823 --> 00:14:35,223
あとは 行けるところまで息を切らせてたい
After that, I want to run breathless as far as I can go!

168
00:14:35,323 --> 00:14:39,823
何万と手を叩くオーディエンス 割れんばかり響く大歓声
Tens of thousands of audience members clapping hands, deafening cheers echoing out!

169
00:14:40,023 --> 00:14:42,023
ファンファーレが鳴る
The fanfare sounds!

170
00:14:42,123 --> 00:14:44,823
心音が高まる
Our heartbeats quicken!

171
00:14:44,823 --> 00:14:49,223
動き出す秒針 夢のゲートが開く
The second hand starts moving, the gate of dreams opens!

172
00:14:49,223 --> 00:14:50,023
行くぞー！
Let's go!

173
00:14:50,023 --> 00:14:56,023
走って 走って 憧れを追い越して
Run, run, passing beyond admiration!

174
00:14:56,023 --> 00:14:58,223
次は誰の番だ！？
Whose turn is next!?

175
00:14:58,223 --> 00:15:00,023
さあ目指すはスーパー…
Now, aiming for the super...

176
00:15:00,071 --> 00:15:01,171
さあ目指すはスーパースター
Come on, aiming for superstar!

177
00:15:01,171 --> 00:15:02,171
生きてく
Living...

178
00:15:02,171 --> 00:15:03,071
意味なんて
...what purpose...

179
00:15:03,071 --> 00:15:06,771
ぶっちぎった後でついてくる
...will follow after leaving everyone behind!

180
00:15:06,771 --> 00:15:07,671
勝ちたい！
I want to win!

181
00:15:07,671 --> 00:15:09,671
そうこれは本能
Yes, this is instinct!

182
00:15:09,671 --> 00:15:10,571
走りたい！
I want to run!

183
00:15:10,571 --> 00:15:12,171
止まない衝動
An unstoppable impulse!

184
00:15:12,171 --> 00:15:13,171
叫びたい！
I want to shout!

185
00:15:13,171 --> 00:15:15,671
勝利の雄叫びを
A shout of victory!

186
00:15:15,671 --> 00:15:18,071
轟け！
Resonate!

187
00:15:22,571 --> 00:15:24,971
誰かとバチバチ競うことでしか
Only by fiercely competing with someone

188
00:15:24,971 --> 00:15:28,871
到達し得ない輝かしいゴールライン
can you reach the brilliant goal line!

189
00:15:28,871 --> 00:15:29,871
AH どんな
Ah, no matter what...

190
00:15:29,871 --> 00:15:32,871
理屈でも言語化できない感情
...emotions can't be put into logic or words!

191
00:15:32,871 --> 00:15:34,471
科学を超えて
Beyond science!

192
00:15:34,471 --> 00:15:35,871
ざっと超えて
Way beyond!

193
00:15:35,871 --> 00:15:38,871
熱い勝負したい したい したい
I wanna have an intense battle, wanna, wanna!

194
00:15:38,871 --> 00:15:40,871
どちらが最強か
Which one is the strongest?

195
00:15:40,871 --> 00:15:42,871
決めよう好敵手
Let's decide, rival!

196
00:15:42,871 --> 00:15:47,871
速い者が勝つ 何も言い訳はなしだ
The fastest wins, no excuses allowed!

197
00:15:47,871 --> 00:15:49,571
よーいどん！
Ready, set, go!

198
00:15:49,871 --> 00:15:51,671
飛ばして 飛ばして
Blast off, blast off!

199
00:15:51,671 --> 00:15:54,471
涙さえ振り切って
Shaking off even tears,

200
00:15:54,471 --> 00:15:59,971
前に足を出すんだ 悩む暇なんてない
Step forward, there's no time to hesitate!

201
00:15:59,971 --> 00:16:03,271
答えを出すのは
Finding the answer...

202
00:16:03,271 --> 00:16:06,571
ゴールした後でも遅くない
...isn't too late even after crossing the goal!

203
00:16:06,571 --> 00:16:08,871
抗え本能
Resist, instinct!

204
00:16:08,871 --> 00:16:09,671
絶好！
Perfect shape!

205
00:16:09,671 --> 00:16:11,771
譲れない頂上
An unyielding summit!

206
00:16:11,771 --> 00:16:12,771
騒ぎたい！
I wanna make some noise!

207
00:16:12,771 --> 00:16:15,571
王者の雄叫びに
To the champion's roar,

208
00:16:15,571 --> 00:16:17,371
続け！
follow!

209
00:16:17,371 --> 00:16:18,771
Ready!!

210
00:16:18,771 --> 00:16:20,171
Steady!!

211
00:16:20,171 --> 00:16:21,871
Derby!!

212
00:16:21,871 --> 00:16:23,271
Ready!!

213
00:16:23,271 --> 00:16:24,671
Steady!!

214
00:16:24,671 --> 00:16:26,271
Derby!!

215
00:16:26,271 --> 00:16:28,071
いくぞー！
Let's go!

216
00:16:45,971 --> 00:16:48,371
どんなことが起こったって
No matter what happens,

217
00:16:48,371 --> 00:16:50,871
レースが止まらないように
so that the race doesn't stop,

218
00:16:50,871 --> 00:16:56,071
ずっと続いていくこの友情
this friendship that continues forever...

219
00:16:56,071 --> 00:16:58,771
憎まれ口を叩いたって
Even if we talk tough to each other,

220
00:16:58,771 --> 00:17:01,371
みんな一列になれば
once we all line up,

221
00:17:01,371 --> 00:17:03,571
AH てっぺんめがけて
Ah, aiming for the top...

222
00:17:03,571 --> 00:17:07,571
位置についてよーい
On your marks, get set...

223
00:17:09,971 --> 00:17:12,871
走って 走って
Run, run!

224
00:17:12,871 --> 00:17:15,771
走って 走って
Run, run!

225
00:17:15,771 --> 00:17:18,371
憧れ追い越して
Surpassing our admiration,

226
00:17:18,371 --> 00:17:20,571
次は誰の番だ
whose turn is next?

227
00:17:20,571 --> 00:17:23,071
さあ目指すはスーパースター
Come on, aiming for superstar!

228
00:17:23,071 --> 00:17:24,071
生きてく
Living...

229
00:17:24,071 --> 00:17:24,971
意味なんて
...what purpose...

230
00:17:24,971 --> 00:17:28,671
ぶっちぎった後でついてくる
...will follow after leaving everyone behind!

231
00:17:28,671 --> 00:17:29,671
勝ちたい！
I want to win!

232
00:17:29,671 --> 00:17:31,771
そうこれは本能
Yes, this is instinct!

233
00:17:31,771 --> 00:17:32,671
走りたい！
I want to run!

234
00:17:32,671 --> 00:17:34,271
止まない衝動
An unstoppable impulse!

235
00:17:34,271 --> 00:17:35,071
叫びたい！
I want to shout!

236
00:17:35,071 --> 00:17:37,671
勝利の雄叫びよ
A shout of victory!

237
00:17:37,671 --> 00:17:40,071
轟け！
Resonate!

238
00:17:40,071 --> 00:17:41,571
Ready!!

239
00:17:41,571 --> 00:17:43,071
Steady!!

240
00:17:43,071 --> 00:17:44,771
Derby!!

241
00:17:44,771 --> 00:17:46,171
Ready!!

242
00:17:46,171 --> 00:17:47,571
Steady!!

243
00:17:47,571 --> 00:17:49,071
Derby!!

244
00:18:09,571 --> 00:18:12,771
ひゃあああ〜っ！！冷たーいっ！！
Hyaaa! It's so cold!

245
00:18:13,071 --> 00:18:16,871
バンドして汗かいちゃったからね〜 リフレッシュ、リフレッシュ♪
We worked up a sweat during the band performance~ Time to refresh, refresh♪

246
00:18:17,071 --> 00:18:20,571
ほら、おまるんも早く進んで〜！！
Come on, Omarun, hurry up and move ahead~!!

247
00:18:21,071 --> 00:18:26,071
ああああああ〜〜〜〜っ 地獄シャワー 無理〜〜〜！！！
Aahhhhhhh! Hellish shower, no way~!!!

248
00:18:26,571 --> 00:18:31,571
シャワー浴びて、プールで泳いで遊んだら… きっといいアイデアも出てくるってばぁ！
Once we take a shower and play in the pool... I'm sure we'll get some great ideas!

249
00:18:32,071 --> 00:18:36,571
…そう言って、毎回遊び疲れて終わるんだけどね〜〜
...You always say that, but every time we just end up getting worn out from playing~~

250
00:18:37,071 --> 00:18:42,071
でもさ！夏といえばプールでしょ！ここで何かするのもアリじゃない？
But hey! Summer means the pool! Wouldn't it be great to do something here?

251
00:18:43,071 --> 00:18:47,271
プールでできることといえば…… 撮影会！！
When you think of things to do at the pool... A photo shoot!!

252
00:18:47,571 --> 00:18:50,071
ねねたちの水着姿で！
Featuring us in our swimsuits!

253
00:18:50,571 --> 00:18:53,671
お客さんを…… 瞬殺♡
Instantly knocking out... the audience♡

254
00:18:54,071 --> 00:18:57,571
ダメに決まってるだろ！！ 会長に怒られるよっ！！
Of course that's a no-go!! The president will scold us!!

255
00:18:57,871 --> 00:19:00,271
絶対に盛り上がるのにな〜〜
Man, it would definitely be a hit though~~

256
00:19:00,671 --> 00:19:06,571
……プールにラミィちゃん沈めて 産地直送ラミィ水……これは売れる！！
...Submerge Lamy-chan in the pool to get farm-fresh Lamy Water... This will sell!!

257
00:19:06,871 --> 00:19:11,271
そこっ！ラミィから出汁とろうとするな！ラミィ水は忘れろ！！
Hey, you! Don't try to extract broth from Lamy! Forget about Lamy Water!!

258
00:19:11,771 --> 00:19:16,071
…じゃあ、ライブしとく？ プールサイドで！
...Then how about we do a live show? By the poolside!

259
00:19:16,571 --> 00:19:23,071
まぁ〜そうなるよね〜！ でも夏、プール、歌…最高にマッチしてるっ！
Well~ that makes sense~! But summer, pool, singing... they match perfectly!

260
00:19:23,571 --> 00:19:30,271
いいねいいね！あの夏フェスの曲やろうよ〜！ 水鉄砲とか持って、みんなでびしょびしょになりながら！！
Nice, nice! Let's do that summer festival song~! With water guns and all, getting completely soaked together!!

261
00:19:30,871 --> 00:19:35,071
え？でもあれってエモい感じの 恋愛ソングじゃなかった……？
Huh? But wasn't that an emotional love song...?

262
00:19:35,571 --> 00:19:39,271
それをわたし達なりに歌いあげるってことよ！
That means we're gonna sing it our own way!

263
00:19:39,671 --> 00:19:42,271
フェスにぴったりの選曲だからね！
Because it's the perfect song choice for the festival!

264
00:19:42,671 --> 00:19:46,571
それじゃあ…！終わらない夏にするぞーっ！！！
Alright then...! Let's make this an unforgettable summer~!!!

265
00:19:46,871 --> 00:19:49,271
おー！！！！
Ohhhh!!!!

266
00:20:03,046 --> 00:20:07,546
君と夏フェス
You and the Summer Fest

267
00:20:14,846 --> 00:20:19,846
まだ照れ臭いあいつとフェスに
I made a promise to go to a music festival

268
00:20:19,846 --> 00:20:25,546
行く約束をしたはいいけど
with a guy I'm still awkward around, but...

269
00:20:25,546 --> 00:20:30,846
あまりのってたら引かれそう
If I get too into it, he might be turned off,

270
00:20:30,846 --> 00:20:35,946
控えめに楽しむって決めたんだ
so I decided to keep it low-key and enjoy myself quietly.

271
00:20:36,146 --> 00:20:41,846
でも私の大好きな
But when my favorite rock star

272
00:20:42,046 --> 00:20:47,346
ロックスター真夏のステージで
takes the midsummer stage

273
00:20:47,346 --> 00:20:52,646
スーツを着たロックスターもう
wearing a suit, I just...

274
00:20:53,046 --> 00:20:57,646
我慢できない！
can't hold back anymore!

275
00:20:58,046 --> 00:21:00,646
止まらないのは私の汗
What won't stop—is it my sweat,

276
00:21:00,646 --> 00:21:03,246
それとも君への気持ち？
or my feelings for you?

277
00:21:03,246 --> 00:21:08,546
滴り落ちてく恋心
My dripping love—

278
00:21:08,546 --> 00:21:11,146
こぼれないようにすくってね
please scoop it up so it doesn't spill over.

279
00:21:11,146 --> 00:21:15,846
止まらないのは夏への期待
What won't stop is my anticipation for summer.

280
00:21:15,846 --> 00:21:18,446
忘れられない
This might turn into an

281
00:21:18,446 --> 00:21:23,046
夏になるかも
unforgettable summer.

282
00:21:30,246 --> 00:21:35,546
夏の日差しで焼け焦げそう
It feels like I'm scorching under the summer sun,

283
00:21:35,546 --> 00:21:40,846
すべてがスローモーションになる
and everything is moving in slow motion.

284
00:21:40,846 --> 00:21:46,146
他人の汗もどうでもよくて
I don't care about other people's sweat,

285
00:21:46,146 --> 00:21:51,546
日差しの鬱陶しさも感じない
nor do I feel the annoyance of the glaring sun.

286
00:21:51,546 --> 00:21:59,846
でも私の大好きなロックスター
But my favorite rock star...

287
00:22:00,046 --> 00:22:02,846
ラストの曲終わり
As the last song ends,

288
00:22:03,046 --> 00:22:08,046
ロックスター帰ってく
the rock star leaves the stage.

289
00:22:08,046 --> 00:22:11,046
ライブが終わって我に返って
When the live concert ends and I come to my senses,

290
00:22:11,046 --> 00:22:15,546
それから...
and then...

291
00:22:35,046 --> 00:22:40,346
ずいぶん前のほうに来ちゃってたみたい
Looks like I'd ended up way near the front.

292
00:22:40,346 --> 00:22:45,846
さっきまで二人がいた場所、もう違う景色
Where the two of us were standing earlier is now a completely different scene.

293
00:22:45,846 --> 00:22:48,546
ああ、わたしやっちゃった
Ahh, I really did it this time...

294
00:22:48,546 --> 00:22:51,146
本気だったのに
Even though I meant to be sensible...

295
00:22:51,146 --> 00:22:56,546
うつむく私の隣に君が
As I look down, you come stand beside me.

296
00:22:56,546 --> 00:23:01,846
わたしの目を見つめる君 時間が止まってるみたい
You gaze into my eyes; it feels like time has stood still.

297
00:23:01,846 --> 00:23:07,046
少し笑って君はいう
Smiling slightly, you say,

298
00:23:08,846 --> 00:23:11,446
「新しい君が見れたから
"I got to see a new side of you,

299
00:23:11,446 --> 00:23:14,246
今日は本当に来て良かった」
so I'm really glad I came today."

300
00:23:14,246 --> 00:23:19,546
照れ笑いの奥見えちゃいそうで
Feeling like you might see right through my shy smile,

301
00:23:19,546 --> 00:23:22,246
私は焦って目をそらした
I panicked and looked away.

302
00:23:22,246 --> 00:23:26,146
止まらないのは二人の恋だ
What won't stop is the love between us.

303
00:23:26,146 --> 00:23:28,846
今年の夏よ
Oh, summer of this year,

304
00:23:28,846 --> 00:23:34,046
終わらないでよ。
please don't end.

305
00:24:03,046 --> 00:24:06,846
はぁ～～～～……遊んだ遊んだっ♪
Aah... We played and played so much!

306
00:24:06,846 --> 00:24:12,646
もう、くたくた… で、結局なん〜も決まってないっていう（笑）
I'm completely exhausted... And in the end, we haven't decided a single thing (laughs).

307
00:24:12,646 --> 00:24:18,546
制服、洗濯に出しちゃったし…… 今日の衣装、いつもの着替えしかないよ～
I sent my uniform to the laundry, so for today's outfit, I only have my usual spare clothes...

308
